Elementary Staffs for Forge 1.20.1

Copyright

Elementary Staffs is the work of Kroko (KrokoOnAir), who published it under
the MIT license. The license file of the original leaves the copyright
holder blank. The author is Kroko according to the mod metadata of
Elementary Staffs 2.0.0.

The port to Minecraft 1.20.1 with Forge 47 was made by kleberbaum in
November 2026 for the SkyTekx3 modpack. It is an unofficial port and is
neither affiliated with nor endorsed by Kroko.

Changes

The Kotlin code of 2.0.0 for Fabric was rewritten in Java for Forge
without owo-lib and without mixins. The textures, sounds, item models,
recipes, loot tables and tags are the files of 2.0.0, moved from the
namespace elementary-staffs to elementary_staffs. The English texts keep
the wording of 2.0.0, the German texts are new. The README lists the
changes in behavior against 2.0.0 and against 1.0.6 for Minecraft 1.12.2.
The git history of the port records every change with its date.

